{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ce3edfdc5109cda37a9f56cfe5dbc9d709c01e5694bfa3e27ca27ec694f78f03", "ja": "（夏といえばホラー。肝試しの企画で、\nジュリアはかつての歌姫を演じたのだけど……）", "zh": "（说到夏天就是恐怖故事。在试胆企划中，\n茱莉亚饰演了昔日的歌姬，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "9d246dcdcc123f8d839375487973b4c34e3841d2af36162a7382ba5090ab668b", "ja": "ふぅ……。", "zh": "呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7f99d13d39ae046a27491844548c550b24ce8aa3074b79695bad14983ae392f2", "ja": "お疲れさま、ジュリア。\nまだ帰ってなかったんだな？", "zh": "辛苦了，茱莉亚。你还没回去啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "fa37bdcb5879fa7164541bd00a202b4b8b2f8d95767b250e09e3e28d5f0f45ed", "ja": "ああ、あんたか……お疲れさん。\nちょっと、考えごとをしてたんだよ。", "zh": "啊，是你啊……辛苦了。\n我刚才在想些事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "fbcc9a162dcd066e3d09f4ee8aecf40864f328d455eb77026f3d6ef2c1c796b8", "ja": "あたしがやったの、女性シンガーの霊だったろ？\nなんか、乗っ取られてたとかみんな言ってるけど……。", "zh": "我当时演的，是女歌手的亡灵吧？\n大家都说我好像被她附身了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b9024947dabd7fccbb417676be1b6670bfa550c20912176cb5aae585f4af3b21", "ja": "そうだな、全然別人に見えていたけど……\nジュリアはその時の事、記憶にないんだな。", "zh": "是啊，当时看起来完全像是另一个人……茱莉亚已经不记得那时候的事了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "d28e0567649aa8123dd56f62d337362b5c00e43a06a84adbd1a437356b754d7b", "ja": "ああ。だから、イマイチ現実味がないんだけど……\nもしあたしが同じ立場なら、とか考えちゃってさ。", "zh": "嗯。所以总觉得不太真实……不知不觉就会想，要是我当时也处在同样的立场上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ad30c984380ef21b9ddf9cf6df4be43f2d75ac1cb316b5831c30e53f0d8d367b", "ja": "さ、さすがにそれは縁起でもない気がするが……。\n何か悩みとか、辛い事でもあったのか？", "zh": "不、不至于，我觉得那也太不吉利了……  \n是遇到什么烦恼，或者有什么难受的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "659ae62146bcde1d923365cac70715b0338d57a3eba98b61d74eb52632ad1da4", "ja": "待て待て、ヘンな意味じゃないって！\nそんな悲しそうな顔するなよ……ったく。", "zh": "等等，我不是那个奇怪的意思啦！\n别露出那么难过的表情啊……真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "57c9f7829343ec073c392fadefae59b8073275d1fa66c589764f522455c90710", "ja": "逆だよ、逆。後悔しないためにも、あたしは\n全力で駆け抜けてやるって、気合いを入れてたんだ。", "zh": "反了，反了。为了不留下遗憾，我可是给自己打足了气，打算全力跑到底的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3e7ecda09fedf2f25cacf1d729dc3bbfaa7f2bd0cb5127caf2173bcf649e5850", "ja": "なんだ……そうだったのか。\n深刻な顔をしてるから、ビックリしたよ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……\n看你一脸严肃的样子，可把我吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "132c9b6d8a5c5ff184381c15372600d337838f574202cd188f9a77669079ce8a", "ja": "はは、あんたの心配性は筋金入りだな。", "zh": "哈哈，你这爱操心的毛病真是根深蒂固啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3b62ab64ad4275bb7d245e42bf46336ba19ec1a7170414038077b073f24b4dc3", "ja": "そりゃ心配もするさ。俺は\nジュリアのプロデューサーなんだから。", "zh": "那当然会担心啊。我可是\n茱莉亚的制作人嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "7db2d9d06692aad21e4b014d9fdeb56ad67743ea5299576b887008a23a4435a8", "ja": "ん……まあ、なんだ。そう改まって言われると、\nちょっとくすぐったいな……。", "zh": "唔……怎么说呢。被你这么郑重其事地一说，\n感觉有点怪不好意思的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "90cbed069a2aeea73f673721649f6bfe25463d16245435b0fd086b312f1f1731", "ja": "でも、あんたがいてくれるから、あたしは\n安心してアイドルをやってられる。", "zh": "不过，正因为有你在，我才能安心地当偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "a33d9ed1e65ed02bc94c38e7de1424e579a41a6b050bd51a32baa338b7d36a17", "ja": "あたしとあんたは、いい感じにバランスが取れてると\n思うし……だから心配すんなって。", "zh": "我觉得我和你配合得很默契……所以，别担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "121b89c7aada934de19cdb8f19704e076b54c8e9cf7a41626a37cc1ea5f2c44a", "ja": "相棒を悲しませないためにも、\nあたしは前を向いてないとな！", "zh": "为了不让搭档伤心，\n我也得一直向前看才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3f68fe48319e1a087886ac682687da88f6d297ecb3908f89b534771b49bbedac", "ja": "そうだな。俺もジュリアの相棒として、\nこれまで以上に気合いを入れてプロデュースするよ。", "zh": "没错。我也会作为茱莉亚的搭档，比以往更加全力以赴地进行制作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "e077d0d84f6d3aedc746b47aa00f0bcef569f6082e17a042109cef3a9ad7be26", "ja": "ああ！\nサンキュ、{$P$}。", "zh": "啊！\n谢了，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0203_1019_p", "source_sha256": "be24da8de877470fbe54ee5194c7760cdb35e45c84adac73fb8bc93ce607875b", "ja": "（そう言ったジュリアは、穏やかな表情をしていた。\nあの時のように……ん？　あの時のように……？）", "zh": "（说出这句话的茱莉亚，脸上带着平静的表情。就像那时候一样……嗯？就像那时候一样……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
